00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.640
that he wished he were white

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:56.250
in order to climb walls like Spider-Man,

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.100
and so that really
shocked me and I thought

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:04.020
he has never seen a
superhero looking like him.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:04.980
See what I mean?

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:09.980
