00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.115
why I was really drawn
to the idea of being-

00:01:48.115 --> 00:01:49.850
- I love that.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.210
It is important for them to see

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.650
what they can be or achieve.
- Absolutely.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:54.224
